TOOL_ENTRY(physics_2d_shape_create, "physics_2d_shape_create", "Create a 2D physics shape. 返回 PhysicsServer2D 的 RID 句柄，不可直接赋给 CollisionShape2D.shape（其类型为 Shape2D 资源）。若需挂载到场景节点：先用 resource_save(class_type=\"RectangleShape2D\" 等) 创建 .tres 资源，再用 property_set 设置 CollisionShape2D.shape 并传 type_hint=\"Resource\"。RID 仅用于 physics_2d_shape_set_data / shape_cast / intersect_shape 等物理服务查询。示例：先调用本工具取 RID 并保存，再按上述流程桥接", "Physics", "physics,2d,shape", physics_ops::handle_2d_shape_create, SCHEMA_NONE)
